               "summary":  "IONQ is in a steep downtrend. It closed at $20.72 on 20 Nov 2026, a new 52-week low and about 72% below its $73.65 high. Price is below every major EMA, MACD is bearish and RSI is oversold at 29.16. The selling mostly reflects sector-wide de-risking plus company-specific overhangs: dilution, a 34.6M-share resale registration and an abrupt CFO exit. Operations were not the problem, since Q3 beat estimates and guidance rose. DARPA Stage C and the NVIDIA order support the trapped-ion thesis, but governance and dilution need watching. Technical stance: bearish."
